  "description": "Hyeon-U, a funeral director, is assigned to handle an unclaimed body with nothing left but the three characters of the name Im Se-Hyeon. Just as he lifts the sheet to send him off on his final journey, as he does every day, he finds himself holding his breath at the sight of Se-Hyeon’s face, strangely vibrant and beautiful. Perhaps it was because that brief yet intense first encounter had left such a strong impression on him. Starting that very night, Se-Hyeon began visiting Hyeon-U’s home. Reaching out with a touch that was both dangerous and dizzying...\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
